	(text_box "LAYOUT NOTE: LOGIC POWER\n* U5: C36/C37 between VIN and GND right at the pins; SW node (5V_SW) short and small; L1 and C41/C42 close; feedback (R33/R34) and ripple parts away from the SW copper.\n* U6: C43 at VIN/GND pins (<1 mm loop), L3 and C45 tight, FB divider at the FB pin.\n* FB1 + C46/C47 near U1; route +3V3A as its own trace to VDDA/VREF+, U4 VREF and the NTC dividers."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.72 40.64 0)
